<!-- components/trend-bars/trend-bars.wxml — 竖向分组柱状图（收入/支出双柱 + Y 轴刻度 + 点选浮层） -->
<view class="tbx-card">
  <view class="tbx-header">
    <text class="tbx-title">{{title}}</text>
    <view class="tbx-legend">
      <view class="tbx-legend-item">
        <view class="tbx-legend-dot income"></view>
        <text class="tbx-legend-text">收入</text>
      </view>
      <view class="tbx-legend-item">
        <view class="tbx-legend-dot expense"></view>
        <text class="tbx-legend-text">支出</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 翻页条：只有传了 navTitle 才出现 -->
  <view class="tbx-nav" wx:if="{{navTitle}}">
    <view class="tbx-nav-btn" bindtap="onPrev">‹</view>
    <text class="tbx-nav-title">{{navTitle}}</text>
    <view class="tbx-nav-btn {{nextDisabled ? 'is-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onNext">›</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{!empty}}">
    <view class="tbx-plot">
      <!-- Y 轴刻度 -->
      <view class="tbx-yaxis">
        <text
          wx:for="{{yTicks}}"
          wx:key="key"
          class="tbx-ytick"
          style="top: {{item.pct}}%;"
        >{{item.label}}</text>
      </view>

      <!-- 绘图区 -->
      <view class="tbx-body" bindtap="onPlotTap">
        <!-- 横向虚线网格：5 条，与 Y 轴刻度一一对应 -->
        <view class="tbx-grid">
          <view
            wx:for="{{yTicks}}"
            wx:key="key"
            class="tbx-gridline {{item.isBase ? 'is-base' : ''}}"
            style="top: {{item.pct}}%;"
          ></view>
        </view>

        <view class="tbx-groups">
          <view
            wx:for="{{list}}"
            wx:key="key"
            class="tbx-group"
            data-index="{{index}}"
            catchtap="onGroupTap"
          >
            <view class="tbx-bars">
              <view class="tbx-bar income" style="height: {{item.incPct}}%;"></view>
              <view class="tbx-bar expense" style="height: {{item.expPct}}%;"></view>
            </view>
            <text class="tbx-xlabel {{item.showLabel ? '' : 'is-hidden'}}">{{item.label}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <!-- 选中指示线：从顶部垂到基线，指向当前选中的那组 -->
        <view
          wx:if="{{tooltip.visible}}"
          class="tbx-indicator"
          style="left: {{tooltip.leftPct}}%;"
        ></view>

        <!-- 点选浮层：浅色卡片，贴在指示线外侧（不压柱子） -->
        <view
          wx:if="{{tooltip.visible}}"
          class="tbx-tooltip {{tooltip.side === 'left' ? 'is-left' : 'is-right'}}"
          style="left: {{tooltip.leftPct}}%;"
          catchtap="noop"
        >
          <text class="tbx-tooltip-title">{{tooltip.label}}</text>
          <view class="tbx-tooltip-row">
            <view class="tbx-tooltip-dot income"></view>
            <text class="tbx-tooltip-text">收入：{{tooltip._fmtIncome}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="tbx-tooltip-row">
            <view class="tbx-tooltip-dot expense"></view>
            <text class="tbx-tooltip-text">支出：{{tooltip._fmtExpense}}</text>
          </view>
          <text
            wx:if="{{showDetailLink}}"
            class="tbx-tooltip-link"
            bindtap="onDetail"
          >查看分类 ›</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="tbx-tip" wx:if="{{tip}}">{{tip}}</view>
  </block>

  <view class="tbx-empty" wx:else>
    <text class="tbx-empty-icon">{{emptyIcon}}</text>
    <text class="tbx-empty-text">{{emptyText}}</text>
  </view>
</view>
